{
  "_comment": "Supply-chain integrity registry for ccpatch. Maps Claude Code version -> known-good sha256 of the EXTRACTED cli.js bundle (the file that actually gets patched: storage/archives/claude-code-v<ver>/cli.v<ver>.cjs, or an --input override). Used by scripts/verify-bundle-sha.mjs as a verify-before-patch gate. Known version + mismatch => FAIL CLOSED. Unknown version => TOFU warning + proceed. To pin a new version, run the verifier; it prints the exact JSON line to paste here. Override with CCPATCH_SKIP_SHA_CHECK=1.",
  "_format": {
    "<version>": {
      "cliSha256": "sha256 hex of the extracted/patched-input cli.js",
      "sizeBytes": "optional integer file size (advisory only)",
      "tarballIntegrity": "optional npm registry sha512 integrity string (subresource-integrity form) for the @anthropic-ai/claude-code wrapper tarball",
      "source": "where the bundle came from (npm cli.cjs | bun-native | extracted)"
    }
  },
